    "identifier": "flying-swallow-straight-line",
    "description": "<p>As a part of the activation of this jutsu, you must have a weapon in both hands that meet this Bukijutsu component requirements.</p>\n<p>You dash in a straight line, up to 30 feet, moving through any hostile creatures space you come across, ending your movement in a space up to 30 feet away from you, in a straight line.</p>\n<p>Make two melee taijutsu attacks. All creatures, of your choice, whose space you passed through as a result of this jutsu count as targets for these two melee taijutsu attacks, comparing their results to each creatures AC.</p>\n<p>On a hit, you deal either of your [Weapons damage]</p>\n<p>Chain 1: Affected creatures must make a Dexterity saving throw, being pulled with you, and ending their movement within 5 feet of the space you end your movement on.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
